    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Class Origins pg. 26",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Class Origins pg. 26\nYou live in dangerous times, and are alert for betrayal or unexpected attack.\n\nPrerequisites: Int 13, trap sense class feature.\n\nBenefit: You gain a bonus on Perception checks made to determine awareness for the surprise round of combat, and a dodge bonus to AC in any surprise round in which you get to act. These bonuses are equal to the bonus you gain from trap sense.",
